 everyone involved as a  consequence we can safely say that the  invention of pure titans is what led to  this current system of one person being  chosen to inherit one shifter explaining  why the power stopped dividing any  further  now i also mentioned that politics would  have been a factor in why normal  shifters were created and the reason for  this is pretty simple willie tyber  explained in the final season that the  nine times were divided among nine  separate clans with the royal family  having the founder the tigers having the  warhammer and the remaining shift is  being divided among the seven other  families judging from the great titan  war it's implied that many of these  clans didn't have the best relationship  and it's inevitable that if one family  has started creating new shifters the  other families would likely do the same  thing in retaliation a scenario like  that would lead to an uncontrollable  number of new shifters being made and so  it's reasonable to assume that something  was done to prevent this from happening  on one hand it's possible that the fritz  family established some kind of document  or constitution which guaranteed that no  family could have more than a single  shifter on the other hand though maybe  their founding titan at the time took a  more aggressive approach and they use  their power to manipulate the minds of  the existing eight families so that no  one would even attempt to divide their  power either of those options would  explain why the number of shifters  stayed so consistent for so long and it  only began to change when the jaeger  started combining multiple shifters into  one body  lastly the third reason there are only  nine titans is connected to isayama's  love for norse mythology as the number  nine does have some significance when it  comes to that topic  in norse mythology there are nine  separate realms including asgard and  these realms are all connected to the  tree of yidrasil in attack on titan  yidracil is equivalent to the coordinate  which is the tree-looking structure that  links all aliens together  this coordinate is how yamir remains  connected to all the nine titans and so  you can see why isayama chose this  number as the number of shifters is  meant to parallel the number of realms  additionally in both attack on titan and  in norse mythology the name of the  original giant was ymir proving that  these similarities were all super  intentional  anyhow in conclusion  two thousand years ago kingfish  discovered a way to divide the power of  the titans and that method was used to  turn his three daughters into the first  hybrid shifters from there more hybrids  were made over the next few generations  which would have included prototype  versions of the nine times we're  familiar with during this time period  the eldian empire would have also been  messing around with titan science which  is how they gradually developed the  titan transformation serum the invention  of this serum meant that pure titans  were now a thing and it permanently  changed the way that shifters were  passed down this provides a rational  explanation for why the empire stopped  making new shifters once they reached  the number nine but the significance of  that number is also linked to norse  mythology  as always thank you for watching this  video and if you haven't already then  please do sub and hit that like button  as it does help out the channel  until the next one peace out

